<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon cash stock trade halted.</title>
<headline>Lisbon cash stock trade halted.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares on the Lisbon bourse has been halted by technical problems, a bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>He could give no further details.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
